      <section id="visit" class="py-28">
        <div class="container-shell">
          <div class="max-w-3xl">
            <p class="section-kicker">Plan your visit · Location &amp; How to Visit</p>
            <h2 class="section-title mt-4">Montaza Palace visit guide — everything you need before the gate</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-14 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-3">
            <article class="arch-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-8">
              <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#8f3d32]">01 · Tickets / fees</p>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black">Treat the price as a guideline, not a fixed promise</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 text-[#62706e]">Recent local reports pointed to a garden entry fee of about 50 Egyptian pounds per person. There may be separate fees for services or other areas, so check the official price board at the entrance.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="arch-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-8">
              <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#8f3d32]">02 · Parking</p>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black">Plan to park near the entrance</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 text-[#62706e]">Car access and internal mobility arrangements change. Do not rely on driving inside the gardens; use the approved parking areas near the gates and ask about available internal transport.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="arch-card rounded-[2.5rem] p-8">
              <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#8f3d32]">03 · Best time</p>
              <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black">October–April is gentler for walking</h3>
              <p class="mt-4 text-[#62706e]">In the cooler months you can enjoy the open spaces longer. In summer choose early morning or late afternoon, and carry water and sun protection.</p>
