                  <p class="font-black">Start at the royal facade</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[#61706d]">Use morning or pre-sunset light to photograph the tower and arches from a distance.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-step">
                  <p class="font-black">Continue along the green promenades</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[#61706d]">Pick one or two axes instead of trying to cover all the gardens.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-step">
                  <p class="font-black">End at the sea and Tea Island</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[#61706d]">Make the end of the visit about the water, the breeze and a break before returning to the gate.</p>
