                <span class="text-2xl">✈</span>
                <div><h3 class="text-xl font-black">From Borg El Arab Airport</h3><p class="mt-2 text-white/72">Car or pre-booked transfer is the simplest option. The distance across the city is long, so leave an extra margin for traffic rather than relying on a fixed time.</p></div>
